==Dialogue==
{{Stub Dialogue}}

===Sit on the sofa and wait for the warp jump{{subst:void|<!--101000102-->}}===
{{Mission Description|type=trailblaze|location=Parlor Car|You board the Astral Express and become acquainted with a group of companions who may not always get along, but are all at least friendly.<br />A journey with an unknown destination between the stars is about to begin. Maybe you really did accidentally stumble upon some set of a Sci-Fi movie.<br />Conductor Pom-Pom announces that the warp jump is about to begin &mdash; seeing that you're still new to interstellar travel, best you find a seat and hang on tight.}}
{{Dialogue Start}}
----
;([[#Gallery|Cutscene]] plays)
::The universe...
::The Astral Express...
::Aeons...
::...Did I get dragged into a science fiction movie or something?
::This "Stellaron" thing... in my body...
::Are you trying to catch the stars?
::Hee-hee, I've done stuff like that before.
::But, it wasn't stars for me though... it was lights.
;(Cutscene ends)
----
:'''March 7th:''' When I first woke up after being rescued from the ice, I could see clusters of stars in front of me. I reached out for them automatically, but they turned out to be the carriage ceiling lights.
:'''March 7th:''' The whole crew was watching me &mdash; it was pretty embarrassing...
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} Rescued from the ice?
::Rescued from the ice?
::'''March 7th:''' Oh, I forgot to tell you.
::'''March 7th:''' Before all this, I was stuck in a huge block of ice drifting through space.
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} The whole crew was watching you?
::The whole crew was watching you?
::'''March 7th:''' Uh-huh! Like I was some kind of weird alien! I don't really blame them for being curious though &mdash; they had no idea where I came from.
::'''March 7th:''' You might not believe it, but before all this, I was stuck in a huge block of ice drifting through space.
::'''March 7th:''' Himeko and Mr. Yang and... who was it again? Anyway, they figured out a way to melt the ice and saved me.
::{{Диалог|Стрелка}} How did you get frozen?
:::How did you get frozen?
:::'''March 7th:''' Who knows? I don't remember anything before that.
::{{Диалог|Стрелка}} Do you remember what happened before you were frozen?
:::Do you remember what happened before you were frozen?
:::'''March 7th:''' I don't remember a thing.
:::'''March 7th:''' Who I am, where I'm from, my name... it's like everything was erased from my mind. "March 7th" was the day they found me, so it stuck.
:::'''March 7th:''' Ever since then, I've been hanging out on this train and following it to whatever destination it decides to stop at. I'm hoping that one day, I can find my past...
:::'''March 7th:''' Ugh, what am I talking about this for? Way to get everyone down, huh.
:::{{Диалог|Стрелка}} Sorry.
::::Sorry.
::::'''March 7th:''' It's fine. I was the one who brought it up.
:::{{Диалог|Стрелка}} ...
::::...
::::'''March 7th:''' Cheer up, (Trailblazer)! It's not every day someone gets to ride on the Astral Express...
